{"ticker":"DGX","updated":"2026-10-30T22:43:58Z","profile":{"longName":"Quest Diagnostics Incorporated","shortName":"Quest Diagnostics Incorporated","sector":"Healthcare","industry":"Diagnostics & Research","country":"United States","website":"https://www.questdiagnostics.com","fullTimeEmployees":60000,"marketCap":27794221056,"trailingPE":25.081675,"forwardPE":21.023788,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":2.3472865,"pegRatio":1.65,"targetMeanPrice":257.26666,"targetHighPrice":279.0,"targetLowPrice":235.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":15,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.1,"earningsGrowth":0.287,"grossMargins":0.33181,"operatingMargins":0.15628,"profitMargins":0.09535,"totalRevenue":11841000448,"beta":0.54,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":256.99,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":171.18,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":1.36},"summary":"Quest Diagnostics Incorporated provides diagnostic testing and services in the United States. The company develops and delivers diagnostic information services, such as routine, non-routine and advanced clinical testing, anatomic pathology testing, and other diagnostic information services. It also provides services under the Quest Diagnostics brand, as well as under the AmeriPath, Dermpath Diagnostics, ExamOne, and Quanum brands to physicians, hospitals, patients and consumers, health plans, government agencies, employers, retailers, pharmaceutical companies and insurers commercial clinical laboratories, and accountable care organizations through a network of laboratories, patient service centers, phlebotomists in physician offices, call centers and mobile phlebotomists, nurses, and other health and wellness professionals. In addition, the company offers risk assessment services for the life insurance industry; healthcare IT healthcare providers and payers; testing and medical director services at hospital laboratories; test offerings in cardiometabolic and endocrine; cancer; clinical drug monitoring and toxicology; infectious disease, including autoimmune; neurology diagnostics, including Alzheimer's disease; and women's health, such as prenatal genetic; workplace drug testing, testing urine, hair, and oral fluid specimens services; and employer population health services, in","summary_zh":"Quest Diagnostics Incorporated 在美國提供診斷測試和服務。該公司開發並提供診斷資訊服務，例如常規、非常規和高級臨床檢測、解剖病理學檢測以及其他診斷資訊服務。它還透過實驗室、患者服務中心、醫生辦公室的抽血醫生、呼叫中心和流動抽血醫生、護士以及其他健康和保健專業人員組成的網路，以 Quest Diagnostics 品牌以及 AmeriPath、Dermpath Diagnostics、ExamOne 和 Quanum 品牌向醫生、醫院、患者和消費者、健康計劃、政府機構、雇主、零售商、製藥公司和保險公司提供實驗室、醫療保健公司的商業臨床實驗室、金融組織、雇主、零售商、零售商提供服務。此外，該公司還為人壽保險行業提供風險評估服務；醫療保健 IT 醫療保健提供者和付款人；醫院實驗室的檢測和醫療主任服務；心臟代謝和內分泌方面的測試產品；癌症;臨床藥物監測和毒理學；傳染病，包括自體免疫疾病；神經病學診斷，包括阿茲海默症；以及女性健康，例如產前遺傳服務場所檢測、尿液人口和口腔產品；","sector_zh":"衛生保健","industry_zh":"診斷與研究","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-02","o":180.9,"h":182.01,"l":178.31,"c":178.7,"v":1109200},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":178.34,"h":179.62,"l":177.04,"c":179.51,"v":689500},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":180.54,"h":180.84,"l":179.38,"c":180.11,"v":585700},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":180.2,"h":183.78,"l":180.2,"c":183.49,"v":556200},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":183.5,"h":183.5,"l":180.91,"c":182.53,"v":438500},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":182.17,"h":183.38,"l":181.17,"c":182.68,"v":435500},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":181.92,"h":182.11,"l":179.77,"c":180.14,"v":652100},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":180.28,"h":184.14,"l":180.0,"c":183.46,"v":598500},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":183.24,"h":185.05,"l":182.51,"c":182.91,"v":454100},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":182.37,"h":183.27,"l":180.58,"c":180.62,"v":642200},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":180.48,"h":181.59,"l":179.66,"c":180.16,"v":549500},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":181.15,"h":183.46,"l":180.52,"c":182.25,"v":662900},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":180.84,"h":184.13,"l":180.71,"c":183.33,"v":667800},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":183.69,"h":185.0,"l":183.26,"c":183.6,"v":1435600},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":183.32,"h":185.51,"l":182.9,"c":184.69,"v":976000},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":184.72,"h":187.96,"l":184.72,"c":186.97,"v":775000},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":186.49,"h":187.92,"l":